      "stt_text": "Okay, a few things for the weekend. First, pick up the dry cleaning before noon on Saturday. Second, order a birthday cake for Anjali chocolate for about 12 people. Third, renew the car insurance, it expires on the 30th. And uh, don't forget to water the plants.",
